2026-07-27T10:32:59.2434996Z i /tmp/RtmpJR7WOx/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:32:59.2435350Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:32:59.2435763Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:32:59.2436504Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:32:59.2437184Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:32:59.2438050Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:32:59.2438841Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
